<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Petrobras 1996 net 664.3 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Petrobras 1996 net 664.3 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state oil monopoly Petrobras has published the following 1996 profit results.</p>
<p>			  1996			 1995</p>
<p>    Net		 664.3 million		  570.3 million</p>
<p>    Gross revenue   23.82 bln		  18.77 bln</p>
<p>Note: All figures in Brazilian reais and according to Brazil's Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (GAAP).</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
</text>
